(184889, '1897836', 'ISO 16610-61', 'Geometrical product specification (GPS) - Filtration - Part 61: Linear areal filters - Gaussian filters', 'Active', 'ISO 8015*ISO 16610-1*ISO 16610-20*ISO 16610-21', '', '', 'ISO/FDIS 16610-61 (2014-11)', NULL, 'ISO - International Organization for Standardization', 'English', 'ISO 16610-61:2015 specifies linear areal Gaussian filters for the rotationally symmetric filtration of nominal planar surfaces and the filtration of nominal cylindrical surfaces. It specifies, in particular, how to separate long and short wave components of a surface.', '0', '124.00', '191.00', 'USD', '', '', '17.040.20* 17.040.30', 'Calipers (instruments)*Coordinate measuring machines*Coordinate metrology*Cut-off wavelength*Definitions*Filtering*Filters*Finishes*Gauß*Geometrical product specification*Geometry*GPS*Measurement*Measurement, testing and instruments*Measuring instruments*Measuring techniques*Metrology*Physical property measurement*Product specifications*Profile*Profile filters*Profilometers*Properties*Ripple*Roughness*Roughness profile*Roughness (surface)*Scanners*Scanning*Specification*Surface finishes*Surface roughness*Surface texture*Surface-roughness measurement*Surfaces*Test equipment*Testing*Waviness profile', '', '2015', '18', '', '', '', '', ''),
