(18776, 'Applied Control Current Trends and Modern Methodologies', 'Tzafestas, Spyros G.', '', '', '', 'C R C Press LLC', '0', 0, '9780824788001', '', 'C018', 'This book provides a representative set of modern methodologies and applications, including new topics in the field, discussing a wide range of issues and treating them in depth. The book describes analytical processes for fault diagnosis of automatic control systems, examines modern sensors and actuators as well as measurement techniques, considers multidimensional feedback control and image restoration procedures, among other topics.Tzafestas, Spyros G. is the author of \\\'Applied Control Current Trends and Modern Methodologies\\\' with ISBN 9780824788001 and ISBN 0824788001.', '0.000000', 0.00, 273.19, '', '', '2024-10-13 09:48:35', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
