(21389, 'United States Women in Aviation, 1919-1929', 'Brooks-Pazmany, Kathleen', '', '', '1991', 'Smithsonian Institution Press', '0', 0, '9780874743784', '', 'C004; C005; C006; C007; C070', 'This volume presents the bold women who made tremendous contributions to the field of aviation at a time when the question of whether aviation was a \\\"proper\\\" sphere for women was still unresolved in many minds.Brooks-Pazmany, Kathleen is the author of \\\'United States Women in Aviation, 1919-1929\\\', published 1991 under ISBN 9780874743784 and ISBN 0874743788.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-18 23:02:47', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
