(24807, 'Vegetable Show, Vol. 1', 'Brown, Laurie Krasny, Brown, Laurie Krasny', '', '', '1995', 'Little Brown &amp; Company', '0', 0, '9780316113632', '', 'C008', 'The characteristics and importance of vegetables are explored in this imaginative picture book that is framed as a vaudeville show.Brown, Laurie Krasny is the author of \\\'Vegetable Show, Vol. 1\\\', published 1995 under ISBN 9780316113632 and ISBN 0316113638.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-18 23:17:12', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
