(27706, 'Decision Support Systems for the Management of Grazing Lands: Emerging Issues, Vol. 2', 'Lyons, B. G., Stuth, Jerry W.', '', '', '1993', 'UNESCO Publishing', '0', 0, '9789231028359', '', 'C008', 'This book aims to demonstrate how a decision support system (DSS) can be of help in the management of complex environments. Drawing on case studies, it is a particularly valuable book for scientists, academics, research administrators, grant foundations, international development and lending organizations.Lyons, B. G. is the author of \\\'Decision Support Systems for the Management of Grazing Lands: Emerging Issues, Vol. 2\\\', published 1993 under ISBN 9789231028359 and ISBN 9231028359.', '0.000000', 0.00, 61.73, '', '', '2024-10-18 23:17:34', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
