(27731, 'Horse and Stable Management', 'Brown, Jeremy H., Powell-Smith, Vincent', '', '', '1994', 'Wiley &amp; Sons, Incorporated, John', '0', 0, '9780632035946', '', 'C008', 'This natural pairing combines the bestselling Horse and Stable Management with its companion volume, Horse Care, to create a comprehensive guide to all aspects of horse care. Practical and informative advice on everything from horse behavior, cleaning, feeding, breeding, and management from top equine experts makes this omnibus edition a terrific value and a must-have for everyone who works with or owns horses.Brown, Jeremy H. is the author of \\\'Horse and Stable Management\\\', published 1994 under ISBN 9780632035946 and ISBN 0632035943.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-18 23:17:34', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
(27732, 'Step-by-Step Successful Gardening Trees & Shrubs', 'Erler, Catriona Tudor', '', '', '1995', 'Creative World Enterprises LP', '0', 0, '9780696202070', '', 'C008', 'Erler, Catriona Tudor is the author of \\\'Step-by-Step Successful Gardening Trees & Shrubs\\\', published 1995 under ISBN 9780696202070 and ISBN 0696202077.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-18 23:17:34', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
(27785, 'Insects and Plants Parallel Evolution and Adaptations', 'Jolivet, Pierre, Arnett, Ross H., Jr., Serowski, Renee', '', '', '1992', 'C R C Press LLC', '0', 0, '9781877743108', '', 'C008', 'Insects and plants, whether or not they coevolved, have intimate interrelationships. This book concisely yet thoroughly describes these phenomena. In one chapter the salient facts known about carnivorous plants are described. In another, ant and plant relationships are summarized as an introduction to this vast subject. Pollination, of great interest to agriculturists and horticulturists, is briefly explained without the complexities detailed in the massive literature on this topic. Many other subjects are discussed, such as the memory of adult butterflies, which enables them to return to their host plants in the case of the polyphagous species. The book is seeded with such thought-provoking discussions as prostitution among the orchids and botanical indigestion in some plants.Jolivet, Pierre is the author of \\\'Insects and Plants Parallel Evolution and Adaptations\\\', published 1992 under ISBN 9781877743108 and ISBN 1877743100.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-18 23:17:35', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
