(28449, 'Tractors/With Supplement', 'Deere and Company Staff', '', '', '1991', 'Deere &amp; Company, John Deere Publishing', '0', 0, '9780866912129', '', 'C008', 'Text covers the fundamental knowledge of the basic components of tractors & information needed for proper operation & care. Begins with identification of tractor types & use applications. Explains theory of operation of engines, transmissions, hydraulics & accessories. Tells how to prepare tractors for the field & provides the \\\"how-to\\\" & \\\"why\\\" information needed for efficient & safe filled operation. CONTENTS: Types of tractors, engines, electrical systems, power trains, hydraulic systems, hitches & drawbars, steering systems, tires & ballast, operator\\\'s controls, accessories, preparing tractor, starting tractor, stopping tractor, attaching implements, adjusting tractor, selecting gears & speeds, operating in the field, operating on the highway, daily maintenance, safety & storage.Deere and Company Staff is the author of \\\'Tractors/With Supplement\\\', published 1991 under ISBN 9780866912129 and ISBN 0866912126.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-18 23:17:38', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
