(30119, 'Discovering Horse-Drawn Farm Machinery', 'Smith, D. J.', '', '', '1996', 'Shire Publications, Limited', '0', 0, '9780852636640', '', 'C008', 'Until the reign of Queen Anne oxen were widely used for ploughing, & most other jobs on the farm. But at the beginning of the 18th century the Agricultural Revolution began and oxen were displaced by horses. This book examines the history of horse drawn farm machinery from its origins through to the 20th century.Smith, D. J. is the author of \\\'Discovering Horse-Drawn Farm Machinery\\\', published 1996 under ISBN 9780852636640 and ISBN 0852636644.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-18 23:17:45', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
