(30175, 'Twin City Tractor Photo Archive  Photographs from the Minneapolis-Moline Company Records', 'Letourneau, P. A', '', '', '1994', 'Iconografix, Incorporated', '0', 0, '9781882256068', '', 'C008', 'A magnificent collection of rare black & white photographs specially selected from public and private archives promote the unique characteristics of these popular tractors. Filled with informative captions providing histories of featured models. The early heavyweights, the lightweights, and the general purpose Twin City Kombination Tractor (Model KT). Sftbd., 10 1/4 x 8 1/2, 128 pgs., 115 b&w illustrations.Letourneau, P. A is the author of \\\'Twin City Tractor Photo Archive  Photographs from the Minneapolis-Moline Company Records\\\', published 1994 under ISBN 9781882256068 and ISBN 1882256069.', '0.000000', 0.00, 109.32, '', '', '2024-10-18 23:17:45', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
