(33571, 'Field Crop Nutrition - Applied Science Concepts', 'Fridline, Clarence R., Miller, Charles R., Stuts, Jacqueline A.', '', '', '1991', 'Ohio State University, Ohio Agricultural', '0', 0, '9781565020306', '', 'C008', 'This student manual presents basic applied science concepts of soil fertility and crop nutrition. Highlights science concepts, student objectives and key terms. Chapter titles include Crop Nutrient Needs, Soil Chemistry and Plant Nutrient Absorption, Determining Crop Nutrient Needs, Nutrient Sources, Fertilizer Selection, Fertilizer Application, and Lime Selection and Application. Helps students make decisions for maintaining efficient fertility programs for field crop enterprises.Fridline, Clarence R. is the author of \\\'Field Crop Nutrition - Applied Science Concepts\\\', published 1991 under ISBN 9781565020306 and ISBN 1565020308.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-18 23:18:02', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
(33599, 'Greenhouse Pest Crops and Their Natural Enemies : Slide Script', 'Lindquist, Richard K., King, Muriel N.', '', '', '1992', 'Ohio State University, Ohio Agricultural', '0', 0, '9781565020580', '', 'C008', 'This illustrated slide script accompanies a separate slide series of 73 color slides (of the same title - catalog # 2072S). The script aids study and identification of insects and mites frequently found on greenhouse crops. Identifies 10 groups of common pests found in the greenhouse and presents useful information for developing an effective pest control program. Includes biological controls.Lindquist, Richard K. is the author of \\\'Greenhouse Pest Crops and Their Natural Enemies : Slide Script\\\', published 1992 under ISBN 9781565020580 and ISBN 1565020588.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-18 23:18:02', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
(33601, 'Corsages and Boutonnieres : Slide Script', 'Anderson, Gary A., Lanker, Teresa P., King, Muriel N.', '', '', '1991', 'Ohio State University, Ohio Agricultural', '0', 0, '9781565020634', '', 'C008', 'Illustrated slide script to accompany slide series of same title (sold separately - cat. # 2212S). Depicts 160 slides showing an overview of flower styles worn by both men and women. Detailed step-by-step instructions show how to wire and tape flowers, make a bow, and assemble simple and complex body flowers. Specialized flowers and techniques expand the topic beyond the basics.Anderson, Gary A. is the author of \\\'Corsages and Boutonnieres : Slide Script\\\', published 1991 under ISBN 9781565020634 and ISBN 1565020634.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-18 23:18:02', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
(33603, 'Fresh Cut Florist Flowers : Slide Script', 'Anderson, Gary A., King, Muriel N.', '', '', '1992', 'Ohio State University, Ohio Agricultural', '0', 0, '9781565020610', '', 'C008', 'Illustrated slide script which accompanies the slide series of the same title (sold separately - Catalog # 2126S). Shows quality, close-up views of flowers used by florists. Lists special information on care and handling. Notes unique characteristics related to use, color, and bunching unit.Anderson, Gary A. is the author of \\\'Fresh Cut Florist Flowers : Slide Script\\\', published 1992 under ISBN 9781565020610 and ISBN 1565020618.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-18 23:18:02', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
