(33895, 'Measure of Emptiness: Grain Elevators in the American Landscape (Creating the North American...', 'Gohlke, Frank', '', '', '1992', 'Johns Hopkins University Press', '0', 0, '9780801839283', '', 'C008', 'Introducing the photographs is a personal essay by Gohlke on the relationship between people and their space, and the ways in which that relationship actually creates a landscape. A concluding historical essay by John C. Hudson details the development and function of the grain elevator and its geographical and economic role in American life.Gohlke, Frank is the author of \\\'Measure of Emptiness: Grain Elevators in the American Landscape (Creating the North American Landscape)\\\', published 1992 under ISBN 9780801839283 and ISBN 0801839289.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-18 23:18:03', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
(33931, 'Keys to Soil Taxonomy', 'U. S. Department of Agriculture, Soil Survey Staff', '', '', '1992', 'Pocahontas Press, Incorporated', '0', 0, '9780936015392', '', 'C008', 'This fifth edition of the KEYS TO SOIL TAXONOMY, prepared by the U.S. Department of Agriculture\\\'s Soil Survey Staff, \\\"provides the taxonomic keys necessary for the classification of soils in a form that can be used easily in the field\\\" (laminated cover, sewn binding) & it acquaints users with recent changes in the classification system. It \\\"includes all revisions of the keys that have so far been approved, replacing the original keys in SOIL TAXONOMY: A BASIC SYSTEM..., & incorporates all amendments & recommendations\\\" of this international committees on low activity clays, oxisols, andisols, vertisols, spodosols, & the aquic moisture regime. This new edition also includes an index. Pocahontas Press, P.O. Drawer F, Blacksburg, VA 24063-1020. (703) 951-0467.U. S. Department of Agriculture, Soil Survey Staff is the author of \\\'Keys to Soil Taxonomy\\\', published 1992 under ISBN 9780936015392 and ISBN 093601539X.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-18 23:18:04', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
(33947, 'Modern Water Control in Irrigation: Concepts, Issues, and Applications', 'Plusquellec, Herve, Burt, Charles M., Wolter, Hans W.', '', '', '1994', 'World Bank Publications', '0', 0, '9780821328194', '', 'C008', 'Plusquellec, Herve is the author of \\\'Modern Water Control in Irrigation: Concepts, Issues, and Applications\\\', published 1994 under ISBN 9780821328194 and ISBN 0821328190.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-18 23:18:04', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
(33953, 'Agriscience: Fundamentals and Applications', 'Cooper, Elmer L.', '', '', '1996', 'Delmar Cengage Learning', '0', 0, '9780827362802', '', 'C008', 'Cooper, Elmer L. is the author of \\\'Agriscience: Fundamentals and Applications\\\', published 1996 under ISBN 9780827362802 and ISBN 0827362803.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-18 23:18:04', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
(33993, 'Lockhart & Wiseman\\\'s Crop Husbandry: Including Grasslands, Seventh Edition', 'Wiseman, A. J., Finch, S. J., Samuel, A. M.', '', '', '1993', 'Elsevier Science &amp; Technology Books', '0', 0, '9780080420035', '', 'C008', 'This book presents the essential basic husbandry techniques relevant to optimum crop output in a comprehensive and easily understood manner. The seventh edition includes new material including the Control of Substances Hazardous to Health Regulations and also the various \\\'Codes of Good Agricultural Practice\\\'. The growing pressure on the countryside is considered, together with the need for greater compatability between farming, wildlife and countryside conservation. The authors have retained a practical approach and the text is now presented in specific sections to enable easier reference. This popular textbook is a standard work for students of crop husbandry at all levels.Wiseman, A. J. is the author of \\\'Lockhart & Wiseman\\\'s Crop Husbandry: Including Grasslands, Seventh Edition\\\', published 1993 under ISBN 9780080420035 and ISBN 0080420036.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-18 23:18:04', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
(34074, 'Forage Tree Legumes in Tropical Agriculture (Cabi)', 'Gutteridge, R. C., Shelton, H. M.', '', '', '1994', 'CABI', '0', 0, '9780851988689', '', 'C008', 'Tree legumes serve a multitude of purposes in agriculture and forestry, including forage for animal production, fuel wood and timber production, soil conservation and fertility improvement. Their role and potential is being increasingly recognized for both intensive and extensive agroforestry systems, particularly in humid and semiarid regions of the tropics. This book provides an introduction to forage tree legumes for advanced students of crop science, animal nutrition and forestry. It describes the main genera and species concerned, including Leucaena, Sesbania, Calliandra, Acacia, Prosopis and many others. Chapters on the production and management of tree legumes are followed by a number looking at animal production, incuding topics such as nutritive value and antinutritive factors. Most of these issues are applicable worldwide, but the book also includes a number of case studies of the use of tree legumes in Queensland and Southeast Asia.Gutteridge, R. C. is the author of \\\'Forage Tree Legumes in Tropical Agriculture (Cabi)\\\', published 1994 under ISBN 9780851988689 and ISBN 0851988687.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-18 23:18:04', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
(34111, 'Handbook on Reference Methods for Soil Analysis', 'Soil and Plant Analysis Council Staff', '', '', '1992', 'Council on Soil Testing &amp; Plant Analysis', '0', 0, '9780962760617', '', 'C008', 'Soil and Plant Analysis Council Staff is the author of \\\'Handbook on Reference Methods for Soil Analysis\\\', published 1992 under ISBN 9780962760617 and ISBN 0962760617.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-18 23:18:05', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
(34139, 'Genetics of Wood Production (Springer Series in Wood Science)', 'Zobel, Bruce J., Jett, Jackson B.', '', '', '1995', 'Springer', '0', 0, '9783540588412', '', 'C008', 'Zobel, Bruce J. is the author of \\\'Genetics of Wood Production (Springer Series in Wood Science)\\\', published 1995 under ISBN 9783540588412 and ISBN 3540588418.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-18 23:18:05', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
