(34325, 'Managing Irrigation: Analyzing and Improving the Performance of Bureaucracies', 'Uphoff, Norman, Ramamurthy, Priti, Steiner, Roy', '', '', '1991', 'SAGE Publications, Incorporated', '0', 0, '9780803996663', '', 'C008', 'Increasing attention has been given in recent years to how the participation of farmers in irrigation management can improve the efficiency, equity and overall performance of irrigation systems. This book addresses the other part of the management \\\'equation\\\', namely the structure and performance of bureaucracies that are responsible for managing these systems.Uphoff, Norman is the author of \\\'Managing Irrigation: Analyzing and Improving the Performance of Bureaucracies\\\', published 1991 under ISBN 9780803996663 and ISBN 0803996667.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-18 23:18:06', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
