(35877, 'Keeping a Cow', 'Wilson, Jim', '', '', '1993', 'Simon &amp; Schuster Australia', '0', 0, '9780864173133', '', 'C008', 'Illustrated craft book that covers the basic principles of flower arranging and presents 17 examples of finished arrangements with detailed instructions. Includes a section on how best to dry flowers and has extensive illustrated listings of flowers and foliages best suited to the various techniques. Includes an index. The author is a floral consultant, decorator and teacher. Her other books are \\\'Flower Arranging Australian Natives\\\'\\\' and \\\'Flower Arranging for Weddings\\\'\\\'.Wilson, Jim is the author of \\\'Keeping a Cow\\\', published 1993 under ISBN 9780864173133 and ISBN 086417313X.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-18 23:18:13', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
(35879, 'Information Sources in Agriculture and Horticulture', 'Lilley, George P.', '', '', '1995', 'Saur Verlag GmbH &amp; Company, K. G.', '0', 0, '9780862919023', '', 'C008', 'Emphasizes practical techniques & research, as well as the economic & environmental impacts, of agriculture. Fourteen specialized topics are surveyed, including organic farming, biotechnology, management practices, & more.Lilley, George P. is the author of \\\'Information Sources in Agriculture and Horticulture\\\', published 1995 under ISBN 9780862919023 and ISBN 0862919029.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-18 23:18:13', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0);
