(37642, 'Herbicide Resistance in Plants: Biology and Biochemistry', 'Powles, Stephen, Holtum, Joseph', '', '', '1994', 'C R C Press LLC', '0', 0, '9780873717137', '', 'C008', 'The late 1980s saw an explosion in the amount & diversity of herbicide resistance, posing a threat to crop production in many countries. The rapid escalation in herbicide resistance worldwide & in the understanding of resistance at the population, biochemical, & molecular level is the focus of this timely book. Leading researchers from North America, Australia, & Western Europe present lucid reviews that consider the population dynamics & genetics, biochemistry, & agro-ecology of resistance. Resistance to various herbicides is discussed in detail, as well as the mechanisms responsible for cross resistance & multiple resistance. This reference is invaluable to those interested in evolution & the ability of species to overcome severe environmental stress.Powles, Stephen is the author of \\\'Herbicide Resistance in Plants: Biology and Biochemistry\\\', published 1994 under ISBN 9780873717137 and ISBN 0873717139.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-18 23:18:22', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
