(38095, 'Electronic and Electrical Systems', 'Deere and Company Staff', '', '', '1993', 'Deere &amp; Company, John Deere Publishing', '0', 0, '9780866911931', '', 'C008', 'Covers how it works. Discusses the basics of current, voltage & resistance. Shows various types of electrical circuits. Explains generators & alternators plus the new transistorized regulators. Tells how to maintain the circuits for safety & long service. CONTENTS: Basic principles, basic circuits, testing equipment, storage batteries, charging circuits, starting circuits, ignition circuits, electronic ignition circuits, lighting circuits, accessory circuits, connectors, monitors & controllers, maintenance, troubleshooting & terms & symbols.Deere and Company Staff is the author of \\\'Electronic and Electrical Systems\\\', published 1993 under ISBN 9780866911931 and ISBN 0866911936.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-18 23:18:24', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
