(40089, 'Ostrich Ranching in America: Big Birds Bring Big Bucks!', 'Oliver, Dub', '', '', '1993', 'Oliver Communications', '0', 0, '9780963456601', '', 'C008', 'The South African Ostrich Industry, which has dominated the world market for ostrich meat, leather & feathers for decades, now has a formidable & ingenious competitor - the American farmer & rancher. In just a few years, the ostrich industry in America has become one of the most extraordinarily lucrative agriculture opportunities of the century. In addition to the agricultural community, people of business, industry & the professions are entering the ostrich business in astonishing numbers. The book contains a compilation of information that could mean many thousands of dollars through acquired knowledge of this relatively new industry. It includes: * A fascinating history of the emergence of the industry. * Vital statistics & characteristics of the incredible enduring animal. * Profiles & opinions of many of the country\\\'s ostrich ranchers & veterinarians. * A consensus of the future ostrich ranching in this country & Canada. *Suggestions on buying livestock & promoting your business. * The meat, the hides, & how to butcher & cure. And more, including index. OSTRICH RANCHING IN AMERICA is the first complete inside look at this great alternative to the cattle & farming business. Must reading for those interested in the ostrich industry in America. To order, contact Oliver Communications, Inc., P.O. Box 5515, Shreveport, LA 71135-5515. (318) 865-9094.Oliver, Dub is the author of \\\'Ostrich Ranching in America: Big Birds Bring Big Bucks!\\\', published 1993 under ISBN 9780963456601 and ISBN 0963456601.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-18 23:18:34', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
