(40301, 'Planned Changes in Farming Systems', 'Tripp, Robert', '', '', '1992', 'Wiley &amp; Sons, Incorporated, John', '0', 0, '9780471934172', '', 'C008', 'This book addresses planned change in agricultural research and looks at ways in which information about farmers\\\' conditions and problems is used to set research priorities. This is the central theme of FSR, but is neither an invention nor the exclusive property of any particular research movement.Tripp, Robert is the author of \\\'Planned Changes in Farming Systems\\\', published 1992 under ISBN 9780471934172 and ISBN 0471934178.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-18 23:18:35', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
