(40627, 'Soil Science Analyses: A Guide to Current Use', 'Baize, Denis, Cross, Graham', '', '', '1993', 'Wiley &amp; Sons, Incorporated, John', '0', 0, '9780471934691', '', 'C008', 'Coarse Fragments (cF). Residual Water Content (RWC). Organic Carbon (OC) and Organic Matter (OM). Loss on Ignition (LOI). Particle Size Analysis. Determination of Particle Size After Removal of Carbonate. Calculation and Use of \\\'\\\'Granulometric Skeletons22. Total and \\\'\\\'Active22 Calcium Carbonate. pH in Water and in KCl. Cation Exchange Capacity (CEC). Exchangeable Cations, Exchange Acidity, Saturation Levels, and Exchange Acidity Ratios. Iron, Aluminium and Manganese. Total Chemical Analysis. X-Ray Diffractometry. Porosity and Bulk Density. Characteristic Water Content. Structural Stability and Percolation Tests. Soils Giving Rise to Special Problems. Concluding Comments. Appendices. References. Index.Baize, Denis is the author of \\\'Soil Science Analyses: A Guide to Current Use\\\', published 1993 under ISBN 9780471934691 and ISBN 0471934690.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-18 23:18:36', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
(40640, 'Sustainable Agriculture: Tracking the Indicators for Australia and New Zealand', 'Scarm', '', '', '1993', 'CSIRO Publishing', '0', 0, '9780643055469', '', 'C008', 'The primary goal of this report is to identify a set of practical indicators which can be used unambiguously by decision makers to evaluate the sustainability of agricultural systems at regional and national scales. Key issues in the concept of agricultural sustainability are the links between socio-economic and biophysical aspects, including the off-site effects of agriculture. Indicators that reflect such linkages require a conceptual framework and the development of an accepted methodology which goes beyond the existing measures of profitability and success and allows the status of the resource base to be reflected in the overall worth of the industry.Scarm is the author of \\\'Sustainable Agriculture: Tracking the Indicators for Australia and New Zealand\\\', published 1993 under ISBN 9780643055469 and ISBN 0643055460.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-18 23:18:36', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
