(41151, 'Waucoma Twilight Generations of the Farm', 'Schwartz, Dona', '', '', '1992', 'Smithsonian Institution Press', '0', 0, '9781560981817', '', 'C008', 'Through photographs of the town of Waucoma, Iowa, and the words of five farm families, this book documents the decline of a midwestern agricultural community, its vibrancy diminished by far-reaching changes in the economics and social structure of the American farm.Schwartz, Dona is the author of \\\'Waucoma Twilight Generations of the Farm\\\', published 1992 under ISBN 9781560981817 and ISBN 1560981814.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-18 23:18:39', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
