(41691, 'Knights of the Plow Oliver H. Kelley and the Origins of the Grange in Republican Ideology', 'Woods, Thomas A.', '', '', '1991', 'Wiley &amp; Sons, Incorporated, John', '0', 0, '9780813802398', '', 'C008', 'Knights of the Plow analyzes the ideological origins of the Grange. It traces the incubation adn the birth of a radical farm organization during the economic and social upheaval in rural America in the 1850s and 1860s, primarily through the life and ideas of Grange founder Oliver Kelley and his early Minnesota and Illinois Associates. Based on intensive research in newspapers and unpublished archival sources and on the material culture and symbolism of Grange ritual, this book depicts the tumultuous early years of the Grange from the perspective of its most important organizer.Woods, Thomas A. is the author of \\\'Knights of the Plow Oliver H. Kelley and the Origins of the Grange in Republican Ideology\\\', published 1991 under ISBN 9780813802398 and ISBN 0813802393.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-18 23:18:42', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
(41909, 'Hay and Forage Harvesting', 'Deere and Company Staff', '', '', '1993', 'Deere &amp; Company, John Deere Publishing', '0', 0, '9780866911726', '', 'C008', 'Discusses purposes & uses of different types of hay & forage equipment. Gives theory of operation for each type of machine using color illustrations. Covers all types - mowers, conditioners, rakes, balers, handling systems, cubers, choppers, blowers, & forage harvesters. Explains new large-package hay-handling systems. Explains proper operation & field adjustments. Shows correct steps in maintenance, storage & troubleshooting. CONTENTS: Harvesting methods, planning of harvest, mowers & conditioners, windrowers, rakes, balers, bale wagons, large rollbalers, loose hay stack wagons, hay cubers, choppers, forage harvesters, forage wagons, forage blowers, field operation & adjustments, selection of equipment, comparing harvesting systems, management of total systems & glossary & tables.Deere and Company Staff is the author of \\\'Hay and Forage Harvesting\\\', published 1993 under ISBN 9780866911726 and ISBN 0866911723.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-18 23:18:43', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
