(49130, 'Rock Mechanics Proceedings of the 33rd U. S. Symposium', 'Tillerson, J. R., Wawersik, W. R.', '', '', '1992', 'Taylor &amp; Francis Group', '0', 0, '9789054100454', '', 'C031; C073', 'A selection of papers from the 33rd annual meeting promoting the synthesis of diverse rock mechanic activities in professional societies, industry, academia and government. Coverage includes rock mass monitoring, blasting, subsidence, fracture mechanics, underground imaging and induced seismicity.Tillerson, J. R. is the author of \\\'Rock Mechanics Proceedings of the 33rd U. S. Symposium\\\', published 1992 under ISBN 9789054100454 and ISBN 9054100451.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-19 17:11:01', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
(49132, 'Earthquake Engineering: Proceedings of the Sixteenth Regional European Seminar on Earthquake...', 'Juhasova, Emilia', '', '', '1992', 'Taylor &amp; Francis Group', '0', 0, '9789054100065', '', 'C031; C073', 'The papers included in these proceedings present state-of-the-art information on the design and analysis of earthquake resistant structures. They cover a wide range of topics, including seismic design of structures, software for seismic calculation and design, and seismic codes.Juhasova, Emilia is the author of \\\'Earthquake Engineering: Proceedings of the Sixteenth Regional European Seminar on Earthquake Engineering, Stara Lesna, 6-12 October 1991\\\', published 1992 under ISBN 9789054100065 and ISBN 9054100060.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-19 17:11:01', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
