(49151, 'Effect of Geomechanics on Mine Design', 'Kidybinski, A., Dubinski, J.', '', '', '1992', 'Taylor &amp; Francis Group', '0', 0, '9789054100409', '', 'C031; C073', 'A selection of papers on the effect of geomechanics on mine design. Coverage includes geodynamic phenomena associated with mining, longwall face technology, permanent mine workings and tunnels, ground subsidence, yield pillars and water inflows to mines.Kidybinski, A. is the author of \\\'Effect of Geomechanics on Mine Design\\\', published 1992 under ISBN 9789054100409 and ISBN 9054100400.', '0.000000', 0.00, 82.69, '', '', '2024-10-19 17:11:02', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
