(49156, 'Eurock 93 - Safety and Environmental Issues in Rock Engineering', 'Grossman, N. F., Ribeiro, E. Sousa', '', '', '1993', 'Taylor &amp; Francis Group', '0', 0, '9789054103394', '', 'C031; C073', 'The intent of the symposium was to assess science and engineering aspects of rock mechanics. The proceedings discuss aspects concerning modelling in safety analysis, stability of underground structures, and contribution of incident and accident cases to the progress of rock engineering activities.Grossman, N. F. is the author of \\\'Eurock 93 - Safety and Environmental Issues in Rock Engineering\\\', published 1993 under ISBN 9789054103394 and ISBN 9054103396.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-19 17:11:02', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
(49203, 'Rock Mechanics Proceedings of the 8th International Congress on Rock Mechanics, Tokyo, Japan...', 'Fuji, T.', '', '', '1995', 'Taylor &amp; Francis Group', '0', 0, '9789054105732', '', 'C031; C073', 'Fuji, T. is the author of \\\'Rock Mechanics Proceedings of the 8th International Congress on Rock Mechanics, Tokyo, Japan, 1995\\\', published 1995 under ISBN 9789054105732 and ISBN 9054105739.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-19 17:11:02', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
(49205, 'Weak Rock Tunnelling A Simplified Analytical Simulation, a Pc-Based Model and Design Charts ...', 'Franciss, F. O.', '', '', '1994', 'Taylor &amp; Francis Group', '0', 0, '9789054101451', '', 'C031; C073', 'Weak rock tunnelling is a permanent challenge to tunnel engineers. Severe failure and excessive displacements may encompass large roof and/or wall zones if uncontrolled. This book was written to be of some help to tunnel engineers involved with weak rocks. Using simple statics rules, it explains the mechanics associated with the underground excavation and support installation. Also, it includes a simple PC based code and design charts for early planning and design of common vehicular tunnels as well as for convergence measurements during construction. This simplified model was derived from well-established Rock Mechanics principles and engineering practice. It simulated the overall equilibrium at tunnel heads and is applied to quasi-elliptical cross-sectrions, taking into account not only the lining stiffness and lining installation procedure but also the mechanical properties, geostatic stresses and hydraulic conditions of the rock surrounding the tunnel.Franciss, F. O. is the author of \\\'Weak Rock Tunnelling A Simplified Analytical Simulation, a Pc-Based Model and Design Charts for Engineering Practice\\\', published 1994 under ISBN 9789054101451 and ISBN 9054101458.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-19 17:11:02', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
