(49220, 'Tunnels With In-Situ Pressed Concrete Lining', 'Marennyi, Ya I., Zeidler, Ryszard B.', '', '', '1993', 'Taylor &amp; Francis Group', '0', 0, '9789054101413', '', 'C031; C073', 'Expounds the basics of the USSR-originating advanced method for construction of tunnels for various purposes with in-situ pressure moulded linings. Topics covered include practical tunnelling experience, specific requirements of concrete, operational procedure and equipment systems.Marennyi, Ya I. is the author of \\\'Tunnels With In-Situ Pressed Concrete Lining\\\', published 1993 under ISBN 9789054101413 and ISBN 9054101415.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-19 17:11:02', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
