(49893, 'Engineering Geology', 'Bell, F. G.', '', '', '1993', 'Wiley &amp; Sons, Incorporated, John', '0', 0, '9780632032235', '', 'C031; C073', 'Every engineering structure such as a building, bridge, dam or road is affected by the ground conditions on which it is built. Geology is of fundamental importance when deciding the location and design of engineering works, and it is essential that those involved in planning, development and construction have at least a basic knowledge of the subject.Bell, F. G. is the author of \\\'Engineering Geology\\\', published 1993 under ISBN 9780632032235 and ISBN 0632032235.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-19 17:11:06', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
