(50565, 'Options for Tunnelling, 1993', 'Burger, H. Robert', '', '', '1993', 'Elsevier Science &amp; Technology Books', '0', 0, '9780444899354', '', 'C031; C073', 'The major theme of the International Congress \\\"Options for Tunnelling\\\" is the choice between several options for tunnelling, especially the choice of the construction method - a choice that is influenced by the environment, location, ground and ground water condition, construction costs and timing. Other themes highlighted include research and new developments in site investigation, design and construction of tunnels in soft ground and rock, and (private) financing and risk allocation.Burger, H. Robert is the author of \\\'Options for Tunnelling, 1993\\\', published 1993 under ISBN 9780444899354 and ISBN 0444899359.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-19 17:11:10', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
