(53097, 'Piling Engineering, 2nd Edition', 'Fleming, W. G., Weltman, A. J., Randolph, M. F.', '', '', '1991', 'Wiley &amp; Sons, Incorporated, John', '0', 0, '9780470218259', '', 'C031; C073', 'Thoroughly revised to take into account recent developments, the latest techniques, current improvements & principles in piling engineering, focusing on practice. Provides coverage on topics ranging from ground conditions & site preparation, analysis & design techniques, pile testing, quality assurance, to performance & cost-related issues. Packed with diagrams & photos, it also includes an extensive index.Fleming, W. G. is the author of \\\'Piling Engineering, 2nd Edition\\\', published 1991 under ISBN 9780470218259 and ISBN 0470218258.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-19 17:11:25', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
