(53519, 'EARTHQUAKE ENGNG-10TH WRLD CONF SET', 'Bernal, Alberto', '', '', '1992', 'Taylor &amp; Francis Group', '0', 0, '9789054100607', '', 'C031; C073', 'The official proceedings of the 10th world conference on earthquake engineering in Madrid. Coverage includes damage in recent earthquakes, seismic risk and hazard, site effects, structural analysis and design, seismic codes and standards, urban planning, and expert system application.Bernal, Alberto is the author of \\\'EARTHQUAKE ENGNG-10TH WRLD CONF SET \\\', published 1992 under ISBN 9789054100607 and ISBN 9054100605.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-19 17:11:27', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
(53572, 'Mechanised Shield Tunnelling', 'Maidl, Bernhard, Herrenknecht, Martin, Anheuser, Lothar', '', '', '1996', 'Wiley &amp; Sons, Incorporated, John', '0', 0, '9783433012925', '', 'C031; C073', 'This book covers the history and development of mechanised shield tunnelling. It presents the principles of this construction method and the different types of Shields, moving from shield design and dimensioning through excavation methods, transport of the excavated material and tunnel lining to surveying and machine guidance. Health and safety as well as contractual aspects are also given particular attention. Groundbreaking interdisciplinary work by three experts in the field of mechanised shield tunneling makes this the most comprehensive source of information on this subject up until now.Maidl, Bernhard is the author of \\\'Mechanised Shield Tunnelling\\\', published 1996 under ISBN 9783433012925 and ISBN 343301292X.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-19 17:11:28', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
