(54392, 'Transportation Systems Theory and Application of Advanced Technology  A Postprint Volume fro...', 'IFAC Symposium on Transportation Systems 1994 Staff, Liu, B., Blosseville, J. M.', '', '', '1995', 'Elsevier Science &amp; Technology Books', '0', 0, '9780080422268', '', 'C031; C073', 'The scope for transportation is very large and growing, and includes the main fields of road, rail, maritime and air traffic. The developing new techniques within these fields are capable of delivering more efficient, more productive, and safer transport. The IFAC Symposia on Transportation Systems provides the opportunity to discuss and evaluate future developments in the transportation field. This valuable publication was produced from the latest in the series, providing a detailed assessment of present and future developments of key technologies within the transportation field.IFAC Symposium on Transportation Systems 1994 Staff is the author of \\\'Transportation Systems Theory and Application of Advanced Technology  A Postprint Volume from the Ifac Symposium, Tianjin, Prc, 24-26 August 1994\\\', published 1995 under ISBN 9780080422268 and ISBN 0080422268.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-19 17:11:32', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
