(54421, 'Highway Traffic Analysis and Design', 'Salter, R. J., Hounsell, N. B.', '', '', '1996', 'Macmillan Publishers Limited', '0', 0, '9780333609033', '', 'C031; C073', 'Revised and updated, this is a practical text of traffic theory and practice. It covers road junction operations and design, Department of Transport design standards, key elements of traffic engineering and traffic signal control.Salter, R. J. is the author of \\\'Highway Traffic Analysis and Design\\\', published 1996 under ISBN 9780333609033 and ISBN 0333609034.', '0.000000', 0.00, 82.34, '', '', '2024-10-19 17:11:33', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
