(54549, 'Sydney Tunnels', 'Kennedy, Brian, Kennedy, Barbara', '', '', '1993', 'Simon &amp; Schuster Australia', '0', 0, '9780864175250', '', 'C031; C073', 'Survey of all the underground ways dug beneath Sydney, from the first water supply tunnel dug shortly after the first European settlement, to the recently constructed Sydney Harbour Tunnel. Includes mining, defence, pedestrian, road, sewerage and drainage tunnels. Indexed.Kennedy, Brian is the author of \\\'Sydney Tunnels\\\', published 1993 under ISBN 9780864175250 and ISBN 0864175256.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-19 17:11:33', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
