(54718, 'List of Members 1993 International Society for Soil Mechanics and Foundation Engineering/Lis...', 'International Society For Soil Mechanics And Foundation Engineering Staff', '', '', '1993', 'Taylor &amp; Francis Group', '0', 0, '9789054101673', '', 'C031; C073', 'Contains about 17,000 addresses of members of the International Society for Soil Mechanics and Foundation Engineering. Updated addresses or selections are also available on self-adhesive labels.International Society For Soil Mechanics And Foundation Engineering Staff is the author of \\\'List of Members 1993 International Society for Soil Mechanics and Foundation Engineering/Liste Des Membres  Societe Internationale De Mecanique De\\\', published 1993 under ISBN 9789054101673 and ISBN 9054101679.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-19 17:11:34', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
