(55255, 'Bridge Bearings and Expansion Joints', 'Lee, David J.', '', '', '1994', 'Routledge', '0', 0, '9780419145707', '', 'C031; C073', 'This book provides a guide to movement and restraint in bridges for bridge engineers and will enable them to draw up design calculations and specifications for effective installation, and satisfactory service and durability of bearings and joints. It has been fully revised and updated in line with current codes and design practice, modern developments and products.Lee, David J. is the author of \\\'Bridge Bearings and Expansion Joints\\\', published 1994 under ISBN 9780419145707 and ISBN 0419145702.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-19 17:11:38', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
