(56836, 'Repair of Concrete Structures', 'Shaw, J DN, Allen, R. T., Edwards, S. C.', '', '', '1993', 'Routledge', '0', 0, '9780751400861', '', 'C002; C011; C015; C026; C035; C036', 'This practical and comprehensive book enables the engineer to diagnose the cause of a fault, choose the appropriate remedial technique and ensure that the repair work is completed satisfactorily. It will be of value to all those who need to commission, supervise or carry out repairs to concrete structures.Shaw, J DN is the author of \\\'Repair of Concrete Structures\\\', published 1993 under ISBN 9780751400861 and ISBN 0751400866.', '0.000000', 0.00, 93.22, '', '', '2024-10-19 17:20:52', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
