(58250, 'Best Ways to Heat and Cool Your Home', 'Skimin, Gary K.', '', '', '1992', 'Rainbow Associates', '0', 0, '9780963490100', '', 'C002; C011; C015; C026; C035; C036', 'Rainbow Associate\\\'s book THE BEST WAYS TO HEAT & COOL YOUR HOME enables people building a new home to learn what heating & cooling systems are best for their house & lifestyle. Authored by a licensed Professional Engineer with over fifteen years experience in heating & cooling system design, this book is for the general reader. Jargon is avoided & one easily learns the advantages of different systems, how they work & the best types for them. Often considered too technical, or possibly because of a lack of understanding, the contractor usually makes many decisions that directly impact the home\\\'s efficiency, comfort & livability. After the house is built, the new owner must live with these decisions whether they were correct or not. But by selecting the right system the owner will benefit for years to come in comfort & lower fuel costs. Others who can profit from this book include those purchasing existing homes, real estate agents, contractors or anyone who wants or needs to learn to select these systems. The book is available for $11.95 postage paid from Rainbow Associates, PO Box 1803, Williamsville, NY 14231. ISBN 0-9634901-0-9.Skimin, Gary K. is the author of \\\'Best Ways to Heat and Cool Your Home\\\', published 1992 under ISBN 9780963490100 and ISBN 0963490109.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-19 17:21:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
