(58523, 'Practical Guide to Noise and Vibration Control for HVAC Systems (SI) : SI Version', 'Schaffer, Mark E., Ashrae', '', '', '1993', 'American Society of Heating, Refrigerati', '0', 0, '9781883413040', '', 'C002; C011; C015; C026; C035; C036', 'Provides information for engineers, architects, contractors and other building industry professionals who have little or no experience with acoustical terms or concepts. Presents practical design guidelines to help minimize the possibility of excessive HVAC system noise and vibration in and around buildings, and by suggesting investigation methods to help solve existing noise and vibration problems. ASHRAE Research Project 526.Schaffer, Mark E. is the author of \\\'Practical Guide to Noise and Vibration Control for HVAC Systems (SI) : SI Version\\\', published 1993 under ISBN 9781883413040 and ISBN 1883413044.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-19 17:21:02', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
(58524, 'Independent Contracting : A Primer', 'Renes, Robert M., Ollila, Dale G.', '', '', '1993', 'Eagle Press, Limited', '0', 0, '9781883487249', '', 'C002; C011; C015; C026; C035; C036', 'A New Look At Independent Contracting - For A Change. Recognizing a fundamental change in reactions of companies large & small to employee costs, Eagle Press, Limited has published a new book, INDEPENDENT CONTRACTING - A PRIMER. It addresses the dilemma of those employees today - how to deal with the fact that job security is now merely illusion. Simply put, companies are shedding employees in increasing numbers & filling their needs with temporary help. Authors Renes & Ollila, long-time contractors themselves, wrote about what they know. They explain in great detail how a reader can decide whether he or she is technically, financially & psychologically capable of operating as a self-employed person; & they include a test to allow the reader to determine chances for success. Then they explain how to prepare for & set up the business, market services, perform properly, & keep track of & bill for services, & even what to do if things go wrong. Plus, they include an appendix on tax laws. This book answers not only all of the important questions, but most of the others also. Soft cover, 24.94 plus $4.50 S & H from: Eagle Press, Limited, P.O. Box 303, Noti, OR 97461.Renes, Robert M. is the author of \\\'Independent Contracting : A Primer\\\', published 1993 under ISBN 9781883487249 and ISBN 1883487242.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-19 17:21:02', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
