(59213, 'Construction Industry Forms : 1993 Cumulative Supplement', 'Cushman, Robert F., Blick, George L.', '', '', '1992', 'Wiley &amp; Sons, Incorporated, John', '0', 0, '9780471587132', '', 'C002; C011; C015; C026; C035; C036', 'Volume I of this 2 volume set includes forms used when representing private owners, public owners, lenders, developers, architects, engineers, and design builders. Volume 2 provides forms used when representing contractors and construction managers, subcontractors, material suppliers, sureties and international constructors. The new 1989 CMAA forms and new documents from AGCC are included.Cushman, Robert F. is the author of \\\'Construction Industry Forms : 1993 Cumulative Supplement\\\', published 1992 under ISBN 9780471587132 and ISBN 0471587133.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-19 17:21:06', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
(59215, 'Construction Bidding Law', 'Cushman, Robert F., Doyle, William J.', '', '', '1993', 'Wiley &amp; Sons, Incorporated, John', '0', 0, '9780471596523', '', 'C002; C011; C015; C026; C035; C036', 'This work is designed to provide participants and their attorneys with the information necessary to design, evaluate, and negotiate winning bids. It offers an appraisal of the contemporary bidding process from the viewpoints of all parties involved. Some of the topics addressed include: bid bonds and guarantees, bid awards, procedures for challenging awards, and many others.Cushman, Robert F. is the author of \\\'Construction Bidding Law\\\', published 1993 under ISBN 9780471596523 and ISBN 0471596523.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-19 17:21:06', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
