(60252, 'Packaged Air Conditioning', 'Hough, Bernard J.', '', '', '1993', 'Elsevier Science &amp; Technology Books', '0', 0, '9780750609203', '', 'C002; C011; C015; C026; C035; C036', 'The book begins by discussing the subject of comfort and provides data to enable the reader to calculate a load estimate with sufficient accuracy for \\\'small comfort\\\' applications. A general introduction to psychrometrics and refrigeration follows, which leads to chapters on equipment and controls. The book then deals with duct sizing for small systems and puts forward ideas for presenting proposals to the customer. Finally it gives worked examples for three typical applications.Hough, Bernard J. is the author of \\\'Packaged Air Conditioning\\\', published 1993 under ISBN 9780750609203 and ISBN 0750609206.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-19 17:21:13', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
