(60361, 'Practical Heating, Ventilation, and Air Conditioning', 'Puzio, Henry, Johnson, Steve', '', '', '1995', 'Delmar Cengage Learning', '0', 0, '9780827355927', '', 'C002; C011; C015; C026; C035; C036', 'This book features a service orientation to air conditioning, refrigeration and heating, with the theory and principles necessary to explain both the how s and why s behind those procedures.Puzio, Henry is the author of \\\'Practical Heating, Ventilation, and Air Conditioning\\\', published 1995 under ISBN 9780827355927 and ISBN 0827355920.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-19 17:21:14', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
