(62740, 'Home Repair and Remodel Cost Guide, 1995', 'Marshall and Swift Staff', '', '', '1995', 'Marshall &amp; Swift', '0', 0, '9781568420301', '', 'C002; C011; C015; C026; C035; C036', 'Pricing a home repair is easy & fast with the new HOME REPAIR & REMODEL COST GUIDE published by Marshall & Swift. Whether the reader is a Realtor closing a sale, an appraiser analyzing comparable sales, a do-it-yourselfer evaluating alternatives, or a homeowner on a budget, the updated Marshall & Swift guide can be of great assistance in estimating the cost of home remodeling & repair work. The book covers cost of every conceivable project, from laying a roof to fixing a fence, or installing windows. This handy pocket-sized guide includes descriptions, diagrams, & definitions of often-used terms in the repair or remodeling industry. Material & labor costs reflect continuous tracking of thousands of component costs & 22 labor trades in 825 North American geographical areas. Multipliers permit localizing of costs for specific parts of the country. Tables that demonstrate how to compute total interest paid on a home improvement loan are included, plus examples of various types of home mortgages. For further information or to order, contact Marshall & Swift, P.O. Box 26307, Los Angeles, CA 90026-9954; Phone: 1-800-544-COST (2678). For over 60 years, Marshall & Swift has been a leading publisher & source of building cost data for the real estate, construction, appraisal & insurance industries.Marshall and Swift Staff is the author of \\\'Home Repair and Remodel Cost Guide, 1995\\\', published 1995 under ISBN 9781568420301 and ISBN 1568420307.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-19 17:21:29', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
