(62946, 'Building Surveys and Reports', 'Noy, Edward A.', '', '', '1995', 'Wiley &amp; Sons, Incorporated, John', '0', 0, '9780632039074', '', 'C002; C011; C015; C026; C035; C036', 'This book deals with structural surveys for all types of building - domestic, industrial and commercial - and includes diagnosis of a wide range of defects. It considers both modern and older construction methods, and deals with the particular problems of alterations and restoration work. Guidance is given on how to carry out measured surveys and on report writing. The second edition covers the latest procedures and research and includes an updated legal section, taking new cases into account.Noy, Edward A. is the author of \\\'Building Surveys and Reports \\\', published 1995 under ISBN 9780632039074 and ISBN 0632039078.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-19 17:21:30', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
