(63964, 'Construction Industry and the European Community', 'Chapman, N. F., Grandjean, Christian', '', '', '1991', 'Wiley &amp; Sons, Incorporated, John', '0', 0, '9780632031214', '', 'C002; C011; C015; C026; C035; C036', 'The European Community single market programme is providing new and important business opportunities for Europe\\\'s construction industries and few can afford to ignore it. There has been a flood of information on the subject but there are no single sources of information on the Community and its programme of legislation and other initiatives. This new book provides a succinct but readable guide which will fill that gap.Chapman, N. F. is the author of \\\'Construction Industry and the European Community\\\', published 1991 under ISBN 9780632031214 and ISBN 0632031212.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-19 17:21:37', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
