(65685, 'Air Conditioning Engineering', 'Jones, W. P.', '', '', '1994', 'Elsevier Science &amp; Technology Books', '0', 0, '9780340556375', '', 'C002; C011; C015; C026; C035; C036', 'This classic text covers all the fundamental science and design principles of air conditioning engineering for the student and professional alike. The author uses his experience as a lecturer to present the material in a logical and accessible manner, always introducing new techniques and ideas with the use of worked examples. The new edition has been updated to provide greater coverage of developments in safety hygiene and reduced energy consumption. The use of computerised controls is emphasised and recent advances in refrigeration are included.Jones, W. P. is the author of \\\'Air Conditioning Engineering\\\', published 1994 under ISBN 9780340556375 and ISBN 0340556374.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-19 17:21:49', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
(65687, 'Air Conditioning', 'Deere and Company Staff', '', '', '1994', 'Deere &amp; Company, John Deere Publishing', '0', 0, '9780866911900', '', 'C002; C011; C015; C026; C035; C036', 'This comprehensive text covers servicing of air conditioning systems, primarily for farm & industrial equipment. Most of the information is also applicable to automotive systems. Course teaches \\\"how it works,\\\" \\\"why it fails,\\\" & \\\"what to do about it.\\\" Text begins with basic principles of heat & matter & adds on step-by-step. Tells how each component works. Explains use of various types of servicing equipment. Tells how to visually inspect, diagnose, & test the system. Includes glossary of terms & symbols. CONTENTS: Basic principles, refrigeration cycle, refrigerants, basic refrigeration system, compressors, condensers, expansion valves, evaporators, dehydrators, controls, service equipment, visual inspection, diagnosis, testing, evacuating & charging, troubleshooting charts & glossary.Deere and Company Staff is the author of \\\'Air Conditioning\\\', published 1994 under ISBN 9780866911900 and ISBN 0866911901.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-19 17:21:49', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
