(66035, 'Coulson and Richardson\\\'s Chemical Engineering', 'Richardson, J. F., Peacock, D. G.', '', '', '1994', 'Elsevier Science &amp; Technology Books', '0', 0, '9780080410036', '', 'C020;C030', 'The publication of the third edition of \\\'Chemical Engineering Volume 3\\\' marks the completion of the re-orientation of the basic material contained in the first three volumes of the series. Volume 3 is devoted to reaction engineering (both chemical and biochemical), together with measurement and process control. This text is designed for students, graduate and postgraduate, of chemical engineering.Richardson, J. F. is the author of \\\'Coulson and Richardson\\\'s Chemical Engineering\\\', published 1994 under ISBN 9780080410036 and ISBN 0080410030.', '0.000000', 0.00, 109.41, '', '', '2024-10-19 17:25:29', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
(66080, 'Bioprocess Engineering: Kinetics, Mass Transport, Reactors and Gene Expression', 'Vieth, Wolf R.', '', '', '1994', 'Wiley &amp; Sons, Incorporated, John', '0', 0, '9780471035343', '', 'C020;C030', 'Classical Biotechnology. Enzyme Technology. Enzyme and Cell Based Reactors. Bioprocess Kinetics. Bioprocess Optimization and Control: Antibiotic Case Study. The New Biotechnology. Transcription and Translation of the Genetic Code. Immobilized Recombinant Microbial Cell Cultures and Bioreactors. Gene Expression with Animal Cells. Gene Expression with Plant Cells. Appendices. Postscript. Indexes.Vieth, Wolf R. is the author of \\\'Bioprocess Engineering: Kinetics, Mass Transport, Reactors and Gene Expression\\\', published 1994 under ISBN 9780471035343 and ISBN 0471035343.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-19 17:25:30', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
