(66678, 'Thesaurus of Chemical Products', 'Ash, Irene, Ash, Michael', '', '', '1992', 'Elsevier Science &amp; Technology Books', '0', 0, '9780340583029', '', 'C020;C030', 'Now totally rewritten, \\\'The Thesaurus of Chemical Products\\\' provides a comprehensive cross-section of every aspect of the chemical industry. The two volume set lists more than 40,000 up-to-date international tradenames by which a multitude of chemical products are sold and allows the user to locate all the chemically equivalent products that are available.Ash, Irene is the author of \\\'Thesaurus of Chemical Products\\\', published 1992 under ISBN 9780340583029 and ISBN 0340583029.', '0.000000', 0.00, 185.81, '', '', '2024-10-19 17:25:35', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
(66682, 'Writing Operating Procedures for Process Plants', 'Sutton, Ian', '', '', '1995', 'Chapman &amp; Hall', '0', 0, '9780412993411', '', 'C020;C030', 'Sutton, Ian is the author of \\\'Writing Operating Procedures for Process Plants\\\', published 1995 under ISBN 9780412993411 and ISBN 0412993414.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-19 17:25:35', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
(66684, 'Biology and Biochemistry of Nitrogen Fixation', 'Dilworth, M. J., Glenn, A. R.', '', '', '1991', 'Elsevier Science &amp; Technology Books', '0', 0, '9780444889607', '', 'C020;C030', 'This volume is a wide-ranging critical evaluation by international experts of the state of knowledge in the whole field of biological nitrogen fixation. It includes coverage of the chemistry of N2 reduction, the biochemistry and molecular biology of the molybdenum and vanadium nitrogenases. There is review of the whole range of organisms fixing N2, including the free-living and symbiotic organisms (bacteria, cyanobacteria, actinomycetes). Detailed consideration is given to the ecology and agricultural use of the root nodule bacteria, the molecular biology and biochemistry of nodule formation and fuction. The practicability of extending symbiotic N2-fixation to other systems or to greater efficiency is examined.Dilworth, M. J. is the author of \\\'Biology and Biochemistry of Nitrogen Fixation\\\', published 1991 under ISBN 9780444889607 and ISBN 0444889604.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-19 17:25:35', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
