(67579, 'Wettability', 'Berg, John C.', '', '', '1993', 'Taylor &amp; Francis Group', '0', 0, '9780824790462', '', 'C020;C030', 'Presents current knowledge of intermolecular interactions, the dynamics of wetting and the importance of wettability phenomena in processes and products, detailing the considerations required for wettability in multicomponent systems. Underlying theory and experimental methods are described.Berg, John C. is the author of \\\'Wettability\\\', published 1993 under ISBN 9780824790462 and ISBN 0824790464.', '0.000000', 0.00, 666.33, '', '', '2024-10-19 17:25:41', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
