(68463, 'Transducers and Their Elements Design and Application', 'Khazan, Alexander D.', '', '', '1994', 'Prentice Hall PTR', '0', 0, '9780139294808', '', 'C043; C044; C045; C046; C076', 'Drawing together material that is usually scattered among various sources, this comprehensive and interdisciplinary volume covers the theory, design, fabrication and application of transducer elements and transducer structures and features a wealth of practical formulas, calculations, schemes, various parameters organized in tables, know how recipes, and other material helpful in transducer design.Khazan, Alexander D. is the author of \\\'Transducers and Their Elements Design and Application\\\', published 1994 under ISBN 9780139294808 and ISBN 0139294805.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-19 17:28:53', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
