(77809, 'Electronic Principles', 'Malvino, Albert P.', '', '', '1992', 'Glencoe/McGraw-Hill', '0', 0, '9780028088457', '', 'C047; C048; C049; C077; C135; C148', 'The new edition of Electronic Principles provides the clearest, most complete coverage for use in courses such as Electronic Devices, Linear Electronics, and Electronic Circuits. It\\\'s been updated to keep coverage in step with the fast-changing world of electronics. Yet, it retains Malvino\\\'s clear writing style, supported throughout by abundant illustrations and examples.Malvino, Albert P. is the author of \\\'Electronic Principles\\\', published 1992 under ISBN 9780028088457 and ISBN 002808845X.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-19 20:49:53', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
