(78936, 'Mechatronics : Electronics in Products', 'Bradley, D. A.', '', '', '1993', 'Chapman &amp; Hall', '0', 0, '9780412582905', '', 'C047; C048; C049; C077; C135; C148', 'This book identifies the concepts which underpin the mechatronic approach to engineering design and brings together its principal components - sensors and transducers, embedded microprocessors, actuators and drives to explore their interrelationships. Several case-studies are presented which specifically illustrate the theory and practice of mechatronics in successful real-life applications.Bradley, D. A. is the author of \\\'Mechatronics : Electronics in Products\\\', published 1993 under ISBN 9780412582905 and ISBN 0412582902.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-19 20:50:02', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
