(79217, 'Making Printed Circuit Boards', 'Axelson, Janet L.', '', '', '1993', 'McGraw-Hill Companies, The', '0', 0, '9780070027985', '', 'C047; C048; C049; C077; C135; C148', 'Learn the latest techniques...Making Printed Circuit Boards Learn thelatest PC-board fabrication techniques with this learn-by-exampleguide. The book includes 25 projects and experiments that teach youhow to: Draw circuit designs; Transfer artwork to pc blanks; Etchcopper patterns and drill lead holes; Solder components repair andmodify boards. Master all the latest techniques for low-cost, speedyconstruction and discover applications for surface-mount components,computer-aided design, safety, and environmental protection.Axelson, Janet L. is the author of \\\'Making Printed Circuit Boards\\\', published 1993 under ISBN 9780070027985 and ISBN 0070027986.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-19 20:50:04', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
