(79309, 'Toubleshooting with Your Triggered-Sweep Oscilloscope', 'Goodman, Robert L.', '', '', '1992', 'McGraw-Hill Companies, The', '0', 0, '9780071576574', '', 'C047; C048; C049; C077; C135; C148', 'This illustrated guide explains how to set up & use the technician\\\'s & advanced hobbyist\\\'s most valuable troubleshooting tool-the triggered-sweep oscilloscope. Electronics repair expert Robert L. Goodman describes in detail the very latest triggered-sweep oscilloscopes & new troubleshooting techniques for rapid, surefire waveform analysis.Goodman, Robert L. is the author of \\\'Toubleshooting with Your Triggered-Sweep Oscilloscope\\\', published 1992 under ISBN 9780071576574 and ISBN 0071576576.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-19 20:50:05', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
