(89189, 'Action Packs: Light & Illusion', 'Claiborne, Michele, Dorling Kindersley Publishing Staff', '', '', '1995', 'Dorling Kindersley Publishing, Incorporated', '0', 0, '9781564588975', '', 'C011; C015; C035; C053; C078; C102; C140; C152; C165', 'Each DK Action Pack is an original and exciting new approach to children\\\'s nonfiction publishing. the interactive presentation allows children to explore a subject through a combination of projects, information, and imaginative role-playing. Included are a 16-page guidebook, a laboratory box in which to make and carry out experiments, 3-D images and glasses, moving optical illusions, a board game, and more!Claiborne, Michele is the author of \\\'Action Packs: Light & Illusion\\\', published 1995 under ISBN 9781564588975 and ISBN 1564588971.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-19 21:50:40', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
