(90391, 'Upgrading Existing or Designing New Drinking Water Treatment Facilities', 'Smith, James E.', '', '', '1991', 'William Andrew, Incorporated', '0', 0, '9780815512622', '', 'C054; C055; C056; C057; C058; C079; C080', 'Describes technologies for upgrading existing or designing new drinking water treatment facilities. Prefiltration, filtration, disinfection, and organic and inorganic contaminants are covered. Particular solutions for small community water treatment plants (2500-100,000 gpd) are described, along with 13 \\\" case studies\\\" .Smith, James E. is the author of \\\'Upgrading Existing or Designing New Drinking Water Treatment Facilities\\\', published 1991 under ISBN 9780815512622 and ISBN 0815512627.', '0.000000', 0.00, 83.39, '', '', '2024-10-19 21:57:47', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
