(90590, 'Laboratory Waste Management: A Guidebook', 'American Chemical Society, Task Force on Laboratory Waste Management Staff', '', '', '1994', 'American Chemical Society', '0', 0, '9780841228498', '', 'C054; C055; C056; C057; C058; C079; C080', 'This handy volume is an indispensable resource for all laboratory management and personnel, in both science and non-science areas. It explains in everyday language how laboratories can comply with the regulatory requirements for hazardous waste management. This book covers identification, characterization, handling, and disposal of wastes; organizational responsibility for hazardous wastes; training procedures for laboratory workers; and cooperation with regulators and off-site disposal service providers. A must-have volume for all laboratories using chemicals.American Chemical Society, Task Force on Laboratory Waste Management Staff is the author of \\\'Laboratory Waste Management: A Guidebook\\\', published 1994 under ISBN 9780841228498 and ISBN 0841228493.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-19 21:57:49', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
