(91077, 'Microbial Transformation and Degradation of Toxic Organic Chemicals', 'Young, Lily Y., Cerniglia, Carl E.', '', '', '1995', 'Wiley &amp; Sons, Incorporated, John', '0', 0, '9780471521099', '', 'C054; C055; C056; C057; C058; C079; C080', 'This book examines the role of microbes, from theoretical, field, and applied perspectives, in the degradation of toxic organic chemicals.Young, Lily Y. is the author of \\\'Microbial Transformation and Degradation of Toxic Organic Chemicals\\\', published 1995 under ISBN 9780471521099 and ISBN 0471521094.', '0.000000', 0.00, 97.85, '', '', '2024-10-19 21:57:53', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
