(91799, 'Citation\\\'s Who\\\'s Who Environmental Registry, 1992', 'Citation Directories, Ltd., Inc. Staff, Peed, Joseph W., Riley, Marilyn A.', '', '', '1992', 'Citation Directories, Limited', '0', 0, '9781880486023', '', 'C054; C055; C056; C057; C058; C079; C080', 'Designed as an environmental personnel reference & networking tool, CITATION\\\'S WHO\\\'S WHO ENVIRONMENTAL REGISTRY is the first text of its kind within the emerging \\\"field of the \\\'90s.\\\" This new reference features biographical profiles of over 10,000 leading environmental professionals, with complete information on their credentials & professional affiliations. Companies & institutions seeking environmental professionals can access listings of experts in the environmental sciences, engineering, academia, business, law, management, & more. CITATION\\\'S WHO\\\'S WHO ENVIRONMENTAL REGISTRY is organized by environmental specialty & by geographic index for fast & easy reference. This text also includes a directory of top environmental employers & an in-depth listing of universities offering environmental programs at the graduate & undergraduate level. It will prove to be a popular reference for corporations, government agencies, professional associations, employment recruiters, libraries, & individuals within the environmental field. REGISTRY members are chosen by a selection committee based on experience in the environmental industry, & profiles are submitted & verified by subjects to insure accuracy. For more on CITATION\\\'S WHO\\\'S WHO ENVIRONMENTAL REGISTRY, please call our customer service line: 1-800-848-9059 Monday through Friday between 8 a.m. - 5 p.m. Central time.Citation Directories, Ltd., Inc. Staff is the author of \\\'Citation\\\'s Who\\\'s Who Environmental Registry, 1992\\\', published 1992 under ISBN 9781880486023 and ISBN 1880486024.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-19 21:58:00', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
