(96548, 'Understanding Solid and Hazardous Waste Identification and Classification: A Practical Guide...', 'Dennison, Mark S.', '', '', '1994', 'Wiley &amp; Sons, Incorporated, John', '0', 0, '9780471112648', '', 'C054; C055; C056; C057; C058; C079; C080', 'Provides a systematic approach to understanding and solving the complicated problem of identifying and classifying solid and hazardous wastes. Specific checklists throughout the book ensure that all steps are followed in the process. Appendices include helpful lists of testing and analysis methods, federal and state regulatory offices and other government publications.Dennison, Mark S. is the author of \\\'Understanding Solid and Hazardous Waste Identification and Classification: A Practical Guide for the Waste Generator\\\', published 1994 under ISBN 9780471112648 and ISBN 047111264X.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-19 21:58:41', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
(96564, 'Soil Vapor Extraction Technology', 'Pedersen, Tom A., Curtis, James T.', '', '', '1991', 'William Andrew, Incorporated', '0', 0, '9780815512844', '', 'C054; C055; C056; C057; C058; C079; C080', 'Assesses the state of the art of soil vapor extraction (SVE) technology and summarizes an expert workshop on SVE sponsored by the USEPA. SVE is an accepted cost effective technique for removing VOCs and motor fuels from contaminated soil. The book identifies current SVE technologies, as well as additional research needed in site characterization, pilot systems, full scale system design and operation, attainment of clean-up criteria and closure monitoring.Pedersen, Tom A. is the author of \\\'Soil Vapor Extraction Technology\\\', published 1991 under ISBN 9780815512844 and ISBN 0815512848.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-19 21:58:41', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
