(97369, 'Storage Tanks', 'Cheremisinoff, Paul N.', '', '', '1996', 'Elsevier Science &amp; Technology Books', '0', 0, '9780872013322', '', 'C054; C055; C056; C057; C058; C079; C080', 'Preface. Aboveground and underground storage tanks comparison. Underground storage tanks. Aboveground tanks. Aboveground storage tanks regulations and engineering. Aboveground tank farm specifications. A comparison of steel and fiberglass construction for junderground storage tanks. Fuel dispensing tanks--Factors to consider in location--aboveground vs. underground. A comparison of steel fiberglass construction. Air stripping VOCs from groundwater. Minimizing ecological damage during cleanup of terrestrial and wetland oil spills. Index.Cheremisinoff, Paul N. is the author of \\\'Storage Tanks\\\', published 1996 under ISBN 9780872013322 and ISBN 0872013324.', '0.000000', 0.00, 70.74, '', '', '2024-10-19 21:58:49', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
