(98181, 'Environmental Protection by the Neutralization of Wastewater Using Ph Control', 'Moore, Ralph L.', '', '', '1995', 'ISA', '0', 0, '9781556175268', '', 'C054; C055; C056; C057; C058; C079; C080', 'Neutralization is a costly & technically difficult operation. The author draws on his years of experience as a chemical process engineer to provide useful design information & application techniques for minimizing the waste of resources. The book reflects recent advances in control equipment & system modeling.Moore, Ralph L. is the author of \\\'Environmental Protection by the Neutralization of Wastewater Using Ph Control\\\', published 1995 under ISBN 9781556175268 and ISBN 1556175264.', '0.000000', 0.00, 0.00, '', '', '2024-10-19 21:58:56', '0000-00-00 00:00:00', 0, 0, 0, 0),
