(275048, '2592490', 'TIA ANSI/TIA/EIA-598-B', 'Optical Fiber Cable Color Coding', 'Revised', '', '', '', '', NULL, 'TIA - Telecommunications Industry Association', 'English', 'TIA/EIA-598\n        \n\n      This standard defines the recommended identification scheme or system\nfor individual fibers, fiber\nunits, or groups of fiber units within a cable structure. The method\nmay be used to identify\nappropriate fibers for the purpose of connection or termination within\na communication system or\nfor the topography of long haul, feeder route, subscriber, or\ndistribution applications for both\non-premises and outside plant use.\n\nThis standard also defines the fiber type identification scheme for\ncolor coding jackets for\npremises cable.', '', '100.00', '', 'USD', 'TIA ANSI/TIA-598-D;TIA ANSI/TIA-598-C;TIA ANSI/TIA/EIA-598-A', '2594507;2594407;2593041', '', '', '', '2001', '27', '', '', '', '', ''),
(275049, '2593057', 'TIA ANSI/TIA/EIA-828', 'BTS-BSC Inter-Operability (Abis Interface)', 'Revised', '', '', '', '', NULL, 'TIA - Telecommunications Industry Association', 'English', 'This specification defines the interface between BTS and BSC\r\nwithin the BS. The interface between BSs is specified in the\r\nTIA/EIA/IS-2001.\r\nFollowing features are not specified in this version of the\r\nspecification. They are for further study.\r\nOperations, Administration, Maintenance, and Provisioning\r\n(OAM&amp;P)* 1\r\nAbis Overload control\r\nSMS-Broadcast\r\nInter BSC hard/soft handoff *2\r\nFlood paging\r\n*1 It is recommended that any OAM&amp;P related information be\r\naligned with the TIA/EIA-828, Abis interface. .\r\n*2 Inter BSC (BS) hard/soft handoff is supported in the\r\nTIA/EIA/IS-2001.\r\nThe functions supported in TIA/EIA/IS-2001 shall be supported\r\nimplicitly for the Abis interface and shall not modify the\r\ninformation transmitted on the radio channels.\r\nThe conditions for supporting Abis Interface features are\r\nequivalent to TIA/EIA/IS-2001.', '', '', '', 'USD', 'TIA TIA/EIA-828', '2591359', '', '', '', '2001', '150', '', '', '', '', ''),
